{"id":"3b7a967565c86f39","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-dfa-language-semantics.md","title":"Language Accepted by a DFA","display":"df-dfa-accepted-language — Language Accepted by a DFA","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","aliases":["73-df-dfa-language-semantics","73-df-dfa-accepted-language"],"display":"df-dfa-accepted-language — Language Accepted by a DFA","depends_on":["[[73-df-dfa-extended-transition]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-dfa-language-semantics</span><span>73-df-dfa-accepted-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dfa-accepted-language — Language Accepted by a DFA"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ccb4038df32f3b1f\" href=\"?note=ccb4038df32f3b1f\" title=\"73-df-dfa-extended-transition\">73-df-dfa-extended-transition</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (deterministic finite automaton)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to Q\">\\(\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to Q\\)</span> (extended transition, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ccb4038df32f3b1f\" href=\"?note=ccb4038df32f3b1f\" title=\"73-df-dfa-extended-transition\">73-df-dfa-extended-transition</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Accept}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Accept}_M\\)</span> 是此词域上的谓词，扩张转移仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\times\\Sigma^*\">\\(Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 内调用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q_0,w)\\in F\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q_0,w)\\in F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Acceptance is a predicate with one word argument; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span> is its extension as a language over the same alphabet.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-extended-transition","status":"resolved","id":"ccb4038df32f3b1f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-extended-transition]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-extended-transition","status":"resolved","id":"ccb4038df32f3b1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to Q$ (extended transition, see [[73-df-dfa-extended-transition]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Accept}_M","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\times\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q_0,w)\\in F","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"L(M)","display":false}],"bytes":1146,"backlinks":[{"id":"11d1c892f16eef2d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\widehat{\\delta}_M$ 见 [[73-df-dfa-extended-transition]]，$L(M)$ 见 [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]；无下标的扩张转移只用于这个固定 $M$。"},{"id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L(M)$ (language accepted by a DFA, see [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]])"},{"id":"01b7b9d9615ddaa5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}$ 与 $L(M)$ 见 [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]；$p_{\\mathsf{reg}}$ 的定义域为 $\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$。"},{"id":"dca22faafaee72fb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma},\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}$ and $L(\\cdot)$ (automata and accepted languages, see [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]] and [[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]])"}],"outgoing":["ccb4038df32f3b1f"]}